OL,3,ABangladesh says it was not informed of
OL,4,Aits citizens' execution by Saudi Arabia
OL,5,
OL,6,FBangladeshi authorities say they were
OL,7,Fnot informed of the recent execution of
OL,8,Ftwo Bangladeshi nationals in the holy
OL,9,Fcity of Mecca until after it had taken
OL,10,Fplace, local media reports.
OL,12,FA Bangladeshi man and woman were
OL,13,Fexecuted last Wednesday after being
OL,14,Fconvicted of committing an "indecent
OL,15,Fact" inside a mosque, according to the
OL,16,FSaudi interior ministry. The ministry
OL,17,Fdid not specify the nature of the
OL,18,Foffending act.
OL,20,FBangladesh says it has reached out to
OL,21,Fthe Saudi Arabian government to ask for
OL,22,Fmore details about the case.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
