OL,3,ABangladesh says it was not informed of
OL,4,Aits citizens' execution by Saudi Arabia
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two Muslim countries share a close
OL,7,Frelationship due to their religious
OL,8,Faffinity and strong economic ties.
